Pauta - piano transcription model (src/engine/transcribe/oaf/)

This folder contains code derived from Magenta.js (https://github.com/magenta/magenta-js), the Onsets and Frames
piano transcription model (music/src/transcription/model.ts, transcription_utils.ts, audio_utils.ts, constants.ts and
music/src/core/audio_utils.ts).

